<section class="hero"><div class="wrap"><div class="intro"><div><p class="lbl">Independent insurance agency · Pennowick County (fictional)</p><h1>One agency for the whole block. <em>Ten carriers behind it.</em></h1><p class="lede">We place home, auto, business and life coverage with ten insurance companies, compare them for you at every renewal, and stay on the phone when you have a claim. Each numbered pin marks what a policy covers on an ordinary street.</p><div class="cta"><a class="btn" href="{{ PathBase }}/coverage">Browse coverage</a><a class="btn line" href="{{ PathBase }}/claims">Had a loss? Claims desk</a></div></div>
<div class="stamp">INDEPENDENT AGENCY<b>Est. 1952</b>3 offices · 6 licensed people<br>10 carriers · all fictional</div></div>
